🏗️ Structure
The webpage is a personal portfolio built using HTML and organized into multiple sections with semantic tags for clarity and accessibility.

🔝 Navbar (<nav>)
Contains anchor links to jump to different sections of the page: Home, About, Work, Resume, and Contact.

🏠 Home Section
Welcomes visitors with a heading and a brief personal introduction.

👤 About Section
Introduces the developer's passion for front-end development.

Includes a video (demo.mp4) showcasing skills or a project.

💼 Work Section
Displays a list of three sample projects using an unordered list.

📄 Resume Section
Uses a table to list work experience, positions, and years.

Features an audio player (intro.mp3) for voice introduction or background information.

📬 Contact Section
A form that collects user name, email, and message.

Submits data to submit.html using the POST method.

⚓ Footer
Contains a copyright

